  "dcterms:title": "MedDRA - Medical Dictionary for Regulatory Activities (v25.0 English)",
  "dcterms:description": "Parquet conversion of the MedDRA v25.0 English distribution: a standardised medical terminology (LLT/PT/HLT/HLGT/SOC hierarchy, history, and release files) used to code regulatory information for human medical products. MedDRA is a proprietary terminology owned by ICH and distributed by the MSSO under a paid, category-based subscription; the source files can only be downloaded and unzipped with MSSO-issued credentials and passwords.",
