  "biobricks:reviewed": false,
  "biobricks:reviewNotes": "Determined by BioBricks licensing-annotation agent (Claude). MedDRA is a proprietary, ICH-owned terminology distributed only via MSSO subscription; the brick's own download.R confirms a username/password and an unzip password issued by MedDRA are required to obtain the files. Commercial organisations must hold a paid Commercial subscription and redistribution is controlled by the MSSO, so class restricted / commercial use prohibited absent a MedDRA licence. A commercial licensee (e.g. Merck) may already hold its own MedDRA subscription, but that does NOT grant BioBricks/Toxindex a right to redistribute the MedDRA content; this brick must not be shipped without an MSSO redistribution/licensing arrangement. Human/legal review required before any distribution.",
